# Blaze Robotics Academy — Features for Families

**Audience:** Parents, students, and visitors using the public website or mobile app.  
**Not for:** Staff admin tools, coach portals, or internal operations (see `implemented-features.mdc`).

**Last updated:** May 2026 (beta-2)

---

## What Blaze Offers

Blaze Robotics Academy helps students in the greater Seattle area explore robotics through hands-on programs—from first-time builders to competition teams. On our website you can learn about our campuses, browse upcoming camps and classes, and sign up when registration is open.

---

## How Our Programs Are Organized

When you browse Blaze, you’ll see programs organized in a simple order:

| Level | What it means | Can you register here? |
|-------|----------------|-------------------------|
| **Campus** | A Blaze location (e.g. Bellevue) | No — start here to explore that campus |
| **Location** | The physical address and contact info for a campus | No |
| **Program** | Our learning track: **Explore**, **Learn**, or **Compete** | No |
| **Activity** | A season or group of offerings (e.g. “2026 Summer Camps”) | No |
| **Session** | A specific class or camp with dates, times, price, and seats | **Yes — this is what you enroll in** |

**Tip:** Open any **Session** to see schedule, price, capacity, and how to enroll.

---

## Features You Can Use Today

### Discover Blaze

- **Home page** — Overview of Blaze, campus cards, map, why families choose us, parent testimonials, and email newsletter signup.
- **About Blaze** — Who we are, frequently asked questions, careers, and our team.
- **Program journeys** — Intro pages for **Explore**, **Learn**, and **Compete** that lead into our catalog.
- **Competition teams** — Information for students interested in VEX and competitive robotics.
- **Robotics for beginners** — A friendly starting point for new families.

### Find a Campus

- **Campus pages** (e.g. Bellevue) — Photos, branding, map, featured sessions, and programs grouped by Explore / Learn / Compete.
- **Our locations** — See where we teach and how to reach each site.

### Browse & Compare Sessions

- **Programs catalog** — Search and filter camps and classes across campuses.
- **Browse by track** — View Explore, Learn, or Compete offerings in one place.
- **Camps** and **Courses** — Focused lists for summer camps vs ongoing courses.
- **Calendar** — See sessions on a calendar, including U.S. holidays for planning.
- **Session detail pages** — Dates, times, price, location, recommended similar sessions, and an **Enroll** button.

### Enroll in a Session

- **Register through Amilia** — For most sessions today, **Enroll** opens our secure registration partner (Amilia) in a new tab to complete signup and payment there.
- Session pages show the schedule and key details in the **Session details** sidebar so you can decide before you enroll.

### Stay Informed

- **Email newsletter** — Subscribe on the home page (and other forms) for updates, camps, and news.
- **Unsubscribe** — One-click unsubscribe from any email using the link in the message (no login required).

### Extra Learning Resources

- **Resources** — Download helpful materials published by Blaze.
- **Learning paths** — Curated sequences of courses to guide long-term progress.

