## Features That May Appear When We Turn Them On

Your campus or our web team may enable these for a limited time or a special launch:

| Feature | What it does |
|---------|----------------|
| **VEX Worlds achievements** (home page) | Highlights recent Worlds results and photos when enabled on the homepage. |
| **Programs assistant (AI chat)** | A chat helper on the programs catalog to answer questions about camps and classes (when enabled). |
| **Campus AI chat** | A conversational helper on select campus pages to answer location-specific questions (when enabled). |

If you don’t see these, they are not active on your site yet—not a problem with your browser.

---

## Mobile App (iOS)

- Blaze offers an **iOS app** that wraps our website for a phone-friendly experience: simplified home, easy navigation to courses and campuses, and the same catalog and session pages as the web.
- Enrollment still follows the same path (typically Amilia) unless we enable in-app accounts site-wide.

---

## Family Accounts & In-App Enrollment (Built, Not Public Yet)

Blaze has also built (but **not turned on** for everyone on the public site today):

- Create an account, sign in, and reset your password  
- Parent portal with enrollments, cart, orders, and billing history  
- Save payment methods and pay with Stripe on the website  
- Manage student profiles and family invitations  
- Join a waitlist and use account credits  

When we enable these on the public site, you’ll see **Sign in**, **Profile**, and **Cart** in the navigation and enroll without leaving blaze.academy. Until then, please use **Enroll** on each session to register via Amilia.

